  "name": "Schedule social media posts from a Google Sheets calendar",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule social media posts from a Google Sheets calendar\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Reads the scheduled posts from your content calendar spreadsheet.\n3. Schedules posts to X (Twitter), Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and LinkedIn for the date and time you set.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Connect Google Sheets and select your spreadsheet and sheet.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Confirm the schedule date in each Publish node, or map it from an upstream field.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdd rows to the spreadsheet to queue more posts, or edit columns to change the content. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 612
      },
